|---|---|
| `payment.completed` | Payment settled successfully |
| `payment.failed` | Payment was rejected or failed |
| `payment.pending` | Payment is awaiting processing |
| `payment.reversed` | Completed payment was reversed |
| `payment.cancelled` | Payment cancelled before processing |

